   "widgets_values": [
    "# 03 \u2014 GPT Image 2.5 Premium Refinement Pass\n\nRun this **selectively** on Krea candidates worth the extra cost (identity correction, fixing hands/anatomy, adding a canonical reference for stronger identity lock). It is a separate workflow from the main Krea generator on purpose, so refinement never runs automatically after every generation.\n\n1. Load the Krea candidate you want to refine (Load Candidate).\n2. Load 1-2 canonical identity references for comparison (optional but recommended).\n3. Edit the instruction text on the GPT Image 2.5 node if needed \u2014 the default below is editable, matching the brief you gave.\n4. Queue. Cost is shown live on the node's price badge before you queue (quality/size dependent, roughly $0.01-$0.25/image)."
